--- !u!114 &1241434536
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1241434534}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 0.97, b: 0.92, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 38
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: '<size=70><b>HOW TO PLAY</b></size>


    <b><color=#FFD86B>PICK UP</color></b>  
    POINT at a thing (a gold dot appears over

    it) and squeeze <b>GRIP</b> (side
    button, middle finger).

    It flies to your hand. Let go of grip to drop it.

    You
    can also just touch it and squeeze grip.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>WEAPONS</color></b>  
    Sword on the stone block, sixteen more

    on the tables to your left. They
    snap into a proper hold.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>FIGHT</color></b>   Swing at
    the straw dummy. Harder swings

    flash brighter and sound louder.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>BOW</color></b>  
    Hold the bow in one hand. Bring your other

    hand to it, hold that hand''s
    TRIGGER, pull back,

    let go. Pull further to shoot faster.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>MOTE
    BOLT</color></b>   Empty hand: hold TRIGGER to gather

    light, let go to loose
    it. Throw it or point it.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>PUSH KNOT</color></b>   Both
    hands empty and together:

    hold both TRIGGERS, then let go.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>LIFT
    KNOT</color></b>   Both TRIGGERS, hands apart: loose

    things in front of
    you float until you let go.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>WARD KNOT</color></b>   Empty
    hand: hold A or X for a shield of light.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>CHARACTER</color></b>  
    Press B (right hand) for your stats,

    equipment and a mirror. Push the arrows
    with a hand.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>MOVE</color></b>   Left stick. Click it
    to run.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>TURN</color></b>   Right stick left or right.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>CROUCH
    / JUMP</color></b>   Right stick down / click it.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>MENU</color></b>  
    Y button: comfort, teleport, turning.'
